<title>AUSTRALIA: CommBank appoints Frank Swan as director.</title>
<headline>CommBank appoints Frank Swan as director.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bank of Australia said on Friday it had appointed Frank Swan as a director to fill a casual vacancy on the board.</p>
<p>Swan is also a director of Foster's Brewing Group Ltd and National Foods Ltd and was previously a senior executive of Cadbury Schweppes Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
